# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev`.
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in your ImageKit PRIVATE key.
# Never commit `.dev.vars` (gitignored via .dev.vars*).
# The private key is already stored as a Cloudflare secret for production:
#   npx wrangler secret put IMAGEKIT_PRIVATE_KEY
IMAGEKIT_PRIVATE_KEY=""
